OL,3,GNEWSAShetland businesses hit by
OL,4,Aflooding after heavy rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FShetland Islands Council is working to
OL,7,Fclear drains after businesses were hit
OL,8,Fby flooding as a result of heavy rain.
OL,10,FSeveral cafes, restaurants and shops
OL,11,Faround Commercial Street and Esplanade
OL,12,Fin Lerwick were forced to clear water.
OL,14,FOne business described the rain as
OL,15,F"biblical".
OL,17,FThe local authority is also asking
OL,18,Fdrivers to take extra care.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
